cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use explainer-video in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "explainer-video: an Agent Skill for Chinese explainer short videos"
abstract: >-
  explainer-video is a reusable Agent Skill that turns a topic, an open-source project,
  or an idea into a finished Chinese explainer short video. It ships a shared production
  pipeline (topic research and fact-checking, colloquial script writing, narration to
  word-level timeline, music/SFX design and mixing, a nine-dimension quality rubric, and
  per-platform copy templates) plus two art styles: a hand-drawn whiteboard engine and a
  photoreal vertical talking-head template built on Remotion with thirteen reusable scenes.
authors:
  - name: bobobo2026
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
